{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this fast-paced precision platformer 2D. Jump, dodge, and teleport to survive in an environment that will do everything it can to stop you. Overcome the challenges to unravel the mysterious plot. Are you ready to never stop running?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player 2D adventure where you\u2019ll discover a unique and fast-paced world while uncovering the mysteries behind the plot of this thrilling precision platformer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive increase in difficulty and speed:</strong> As you advance, your speed gradually increases, forcing you to be more precise with every move and making things more challenging step by step.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradual world deterioration:</strong> With each step you take, the environment becomes increasingly dangerous and hostile.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color tones that shift throughout the level.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014960?t=1761693057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014960/665b6b99ccbc931844f2113f78f149c889e1c226/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761693057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014960/a6e29fa3115e36df27923aa8a708a2cc983ea3c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761693057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014960/a6e29fa3115e36df27923aa8a708a2cc983ea3c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761693057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input"